  "content": "\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1446249/description_98bcea1f-c1ed-405c-84a1-445cec1727b7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"310\"></strong></span></h2>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#fff\">想要自定义的《我的世界》第一人称射击武器模型与动画吗？枪械、近战武器、纹理、换弹动画等，全部使用 Blockbench 制作。点击查看：</span></h3>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.fiverr.com%252fs%252f5rWozN3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.fiverr.com/s/5rWozN3</a></span></h3>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fkwork.com%252fanimation-3d%252f52100157%252fi-will-make-custom-minecraft-fps-weapon-models-in-blockbench%253fref%253d24079144\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://kwork.com/animation-3d/52100157/i-will-make-custom-minecraft-fps-weapon-models-in-blockbench?ref=24079144</a></span></h3>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><strong>❄️ 霜冻平原</strong></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">在这里，你绝不会迷失方向。</span><br><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">你能找到严寒留下的痕迹。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">霜冻平原</span></strong> 始于一片开阔的冰封地带，但这一次，寂静被散落在雪地中的建筑打破。一座巨大的冰屋矗立在平原之上。篝火上曾升腾起袅袅炊烟。商贾曾在此交易。雪橇的辙痕曾划过冰面。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">如今，唯有严寒长存。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">这个世界关乎 <span style=\"color:#eccafa\"><strong>空旷中的存在感<span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">，</span></strong></span>&nbsp;并非彻底的孤立无援，而是由前人足迹塑造的生存体验。</span><br><br></p>\n<hr>\n<h2><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><br>❄️ 冰封前线生存</span></strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">雪原世界，并扩展了手工打造的出生点区域</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">地形依然广阔开阔，但现在充满了生活气息。</span><br><br></p>\n<hr>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><strong><br>📖 环境氛围</strong></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">没有预设的剧情。</span><br><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">没有末日背景设定。</span><br><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">只有建筑在寒风中屹立。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">这些建筑并不会指引你的路线。</span><br><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">它们只暗示着这里曾经是可以生存的。</span><br><br></p>\n<hr>\n<h2><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><br>🎯 适合哪些玩家</span></strong></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">✔</span> <span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">喜欢沉浸式冰雪景观的玩家</span><br><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">✔</span> <span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">喜欢在探索中发现精巧建筑的玩家</span><br><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">✔</span> <span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">偏爱手工雕琢的细节而非空旷地形的玩家</span><br><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">✔</span> <span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">追求沉浸式原版生存体验的玩家</span><br><br></p>\n<hr>\n<p><br><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><strong>霜冻平原</strong></span> 并不显得荒废。</span><br><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">仿佛时间暂停了一般。</span></p>",
